<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_app_phppgadmin">AppPhppgadmin</link></para>

<para>This class represents the phpPgAdmin application module in the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It handles the initialization, configuration, and management of the phpPgAdmin module. </para>
<para>
